# ontodag store v1 — the triangle demo's catalogue (examples/demo_triangle.py)
# ontodag's prelude (what `odag prelude` merges), so roles can hang under geo/time
dimension
linear-dimension dimension
calendar-dimension dimension
prefix-dimension dimension
dominance-dimension dimension
count-dimension dimension
weight linear-dimension
length linear-dimension
duration linear-dimension
area linear-dimension
volume linear-dimension
speed linear-dimension
pressure linear-dimension
temperature linear-dimension
energy linear-dimension
count count-dimension
handover
time calendar-dimension handover
geo prefix-dimension handover
size dominance-dimension
# handover coordinates (docs/plans/P1-spacetime-terms.md §3, 2026-09-13): geo
# and time hang under `handover` above, so a bare cell, place or window says
# where/when the offer holds, and a route's `from`/`to` and a transport's
# `depart`/`arrive` — roles under them — are the two ends of one kind; all
# match when one side contains the other (a descriptive head would opt out
# under `descriptive`).
# and the operators (P2-loop-selection.md §10): a category under `operator`
# moves a thing along the dimension whose two ends its give names (`from`
# under operator-input, `to` under operator-output); its parenthesised
# argument is what it accepts — `transport(small-item weight(..8kg))` — and
# matches want-within-give, the operator's own want (Peter, 2026-09-13). The
# solver composes such a give with the thing's give to satisfy a want at the
# output coordinate.
graph-dimension dimension
operator
transport graph-dimension operator
storage graph-dimension operator
from geo operator-input
to geo operator-output
depart time operator-input
arrive time operator-output
# the triangle's trades
service
lesson service
music-lesson lesson
piano-lesson music-lesson
repair service
bicycle-repair repair
food
produce food
local
weekly
vegetable-box produce local weekly
# the asset a deposit is held in (v5, P3 §5a, 2026-09-19): the names are
# ontodag's economics pack's (`xdai stablecoin cryptocurrency currency`), so
# the triangle's makers can bond in the chain's gas token and a wanter's
# `require_point` accept it under any of these
currency
cryptocurrency currency
stablecoin cryptocurrency
xdai stablecoin
